flowchart TD
  P[New problem] --> A{Array or string?}
  A -->|sorted, pairs| TP[Two pointers]
  A -->|contiguous best| SW[Sliding window]
  A -->|range sums| PS[Prefix sums]
  A -->|lookup, count| HM[Hash map or set]
  P --> B{Linked list?}
  B --> LL[Slow-fast, reverse, dummy node]
  P --> C{Matching or next greater?}
  C --> ST[Stack / monotonic stack]
  P --> D{Tree?}
  D --> TR[DFS recursion, BFS levels]
  P --> E{Graph?}
  E --> GR[BFS shortest, DFS components, topo, union-find, Dijkstra]
  P --> F{Choices explode?}
  F --> BT[Backtracking then DP]
  P --> G{Optimise with overlap?}
  G --> DP[Dynamic programming]
